        <h2 class="pp-accent-heading">Everything You Need to Know About Positive Posture</h2>
        <p>Real buyer questions, answered thoroughly. If your question is not here, call or email us directly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pp-faq-list">
        <div class="pp-faq-item"><div class="pp-faq-q" onclick="ppToggleFaq(this)"><h3>What makes Positive Posture massage chairs different from other premium brands?</h3><span class="pp-faq-toggle">+</span></div><div class="pp-faq-a"><div class="pp-faq-a-inner"><p>Positive Posture offers a portfolio of distinct chairs aligned to different buyer profiles — rather than building one chair that tries to serve everyone. The DualTech Pro AI 4D uses AI De-Stress Test™ to match programs to your current stress state. The 4D² dual mechanism system allows simultaneous upper and lower body coverage. Living-room-first design with fabric-forward finishes means these chairs belong in your home aesthetically, not just functionally.</p></div></div></div>
        <div class="pp-faq-item"><div class="pp-faq-q" onclick="ppToggleFaq(this)"><h3>What is the AI De-Stress Test™ on the DualTech Pro AI 4D?</h3><span class="pp-faq-toggle">+</span></div><div class="pp-faq-a"><div class="pp-faq-a-inner"><p>The AI De-Stress Test™ is a proprietary stress analysis system that measures indicators of your current stress level — then generates a Stress Algorithm Score. Based on this score, the chair recommends the massage program best suited to your current state. This removes the decision fatigue of choosing a program after a hard day and ensures the session begins where your body actually needs it, not where you guess it needs it.</p></div></div></div>
        <div class="pp-faq-item"><div class="pp-faq-q" onclick="ppToggleFaq(this)"><h3>What is the difference between the DualTech Pro AI 4D and the DualTech 4D Dual?</h3><span class="pp-faq-toggle">+</span></div><div class="pp-faq-a"><div class="pp-faq-a-inner"><p>Both use dual massage mechanisms and True Zero Gravity® recline. The Pro AI 4D adds the AI De-Stress Test™, a longer 55" WSL-track, 20 auto programs, Wings of Embrace shoulder air cells, wireless phone charging, and ultra-compact less than 1" wall clearance. The DualTech 4D Dual features RotoTech™ rotating glute massage heads (vs. standard lower mechanism), ambient lighting, dual-zone heat at the lower back and calves, and choice of Slate or Linen upholstery finishes.</p></div></div></div>
        <div class="pp-faq-item"><div class="pp-faq-q" onclick="ppToggleFaq(this)"><h3>What is True Zero Gravity® recline?</h3><span class="pp-faq-toggle">+</span></div><div class="pp-faq-a"><div class="pp-faq-a-inner"><p>True Zero Gravity® recline positions your body at a specific angle where your knees are elevated slightly above your heart, redistributing your weight across the chair and reducing compressive force on your spinal discs. In this position, the same roller intensity delivers deeper-feeling decompression because your skeleton is no longer resisting gravity. For buyers with chronic lower back tension or disc issues, this position change alone transforms the quality of the session significantly.</p></div></div></div>
        <div class="pp-faq-item"><div class="pp-faq-q" onclick="ppToggleFaq(this)"><h3>Is the Brio Sport better than the Brio+?</h3><span class="pp-faq-toggle">+</span></div><div class="pp-faq-a"><div class="pp-faq-a-inner"><p>Neither is "better" — they serve different buyers. The Brio Sport tilts entirely toward athletic recovery: Sport 4D pressure that goes deeper and the heated rollers warm muscles specifically before deeper work begins. The Brio+ focuses on comprehensive full-body daily comfort — diamond-stitch furniture design, heated rollers, L-track coverage from neck to glutes, and a Chromotherapy interface — for buyers who want a premium nightly ritual rather than a recovery protocol.</p></div></div></div>
        <div class="pp-faq-item"><div class="pp-faq-q" onclick="ppToggleFaq(this)"><h3>How much space do Positive Posture chairs require?</h3><span class="pp-faq-toggle">+</span></div><div class="pp-faq-a"><div class="pp-faq-a-inner"><p>Wall clearance varies by model: DualTech Pro AI 4D requires less than 1 inch of wall clearance during recline — one of the most space-efficient chairs in the premium category. DualTech 4D Dual requires approximately 3 inches. Brio+ requires 4 inches. The Solara uses an optimized space-saving recline. This means you can place these chairs near a wall, in a media room, or against a bookcase without redesigning your layout.</p></div></div></div>
        <div class="pp-faq-item"><div class="pp-faq-q" onclick="ppToggleFaq(this)"><h3>Can I try Positive Posture chairs before buying?</h3><span class="pp-faq-toggle">+</span></div><div class="pp-faq-a"><div class="pp-faq-a-inner"><p>Yes — and we strongly recommend it. The difference between reading about the 4D² dual mechanism and actually feeling simultaneous upper and lower coverage is significant. Our San Francisco Bay Area showroom carries multiple Positive Posture models for guided demos. Call {{ section.settings.phone | default: '+1 (408) 889-1188' }} to schedule a visit or book an appointment online.</p></div></div></div>
        <div class="pp-faq-item"><div class="pp-faq-q" onclick="ppToggleFaq(this)"><h3>Do you offer financing for Positive Posture massage chairs?</h3><span class="pp-faq-toggle">+</span></div><div class="pp-faq-a"><div class="pp-faq-a-inner"><p>Yes — we offer financing through Affirm for all Positive Posture models. This splits the purchase into manageable monthly payments with transparent terms and no hidden fees. Rates and approval depend on your credit situation. Check current terms during checkout or contact our team for specific guidance.</p></div></div></div>
